  "description": "Cheon-Su Go is a shut-in NEET whose day-to-day is playing games and streaming to his one viewer. One day, he finds himself thrown into the midst of a survival game as a player character. The only clear condition for the game is to survive. The camera is rolling, and the 24/7 broadcast of his fight for survival begins now! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
